<title>YEMEN: Yemen 1996 foreign currency reserves $1.5 billion.</title>
<headline>Yemen 1996 foreign currency reserves $1.5 billion.</headline>
<dateline>SANAA 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Yemen Central Bank's foreign currency reserves climbed to $1.5 billion at the end of 1996, a Bank official said on Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;Foreign currency reserves rose to $1.5 billion at the end of 1996,&quot; the Central Bank official told Reuters.</p>
<p>The bank's foreign currency reserves stood at $450 million at the start of 1995.</p>
